{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master of 4 Swords</strong> is a fast-paced 2D action slasher where your weapon <i>never leaves your side</i> \u2014 literally. Four magical swords spin around you, forming a deadly barrier that you control to slice through enemies, deflect projectiles, and survive overwhelming odds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 Spin. Strike. Survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world of danger and mystery as you explore cursed dungeons, crumbling ruins, and abandoned research labs. Face swarms of enemies and powerful bosses who use the same spinning-blade mechanics \u2014 but with stronger, faster, and more aggressive styles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Combat System</strong> \u2013 Master the art of controlling four orbiting swords. Time your spins, aim your attacks, and block incoming damage with skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Battle brutal foes who can <i>break your swords</i> and outmaneuver you using your own tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized World</strong> \u2013 Explore dark, atmospheric locations filled with secrets, traps, and lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Power</strong> \u2013 Find upgrades, unlock sword modifiers, and adapt your playstyle as the difficulty ramps up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your blades \u2014 or be destroyed by them.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3850520?t=1752741162","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3850520?t=1752741162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850520/642551d785ae5d982478ac05220ff7b13e180f5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752741162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850520/642551d785ae5d982478ac05220ff7b13e180f5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752741162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master of 4 Swords</strong> is a fast-paced 2D action slasher where your weapon <i>never leaves your side</i> \u2014 literally. Four magical swords spin around you, forming a deadly barrier that you control to slice through enemies, deflect projectiles, and survive overwhelming odds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 Spin. Strike. Survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world of danger and mystery as you explore cursed dungeons, crumbling ruins, and abandoned research labs. Face swarms of enemies and powerful bosses who use the same spinning-blade mechanics \u2014 but with stronger, faster, and more aggressive styles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Combat System</strong> \u2013 Master the art of controlling four orbiting swords. Time your spins, aim your attacks, and block incoming damage with skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Battle brutal foes who can <i>break your swords</i> and outmaneuver you using your own tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized World</strong> \u2013 Explore dark, atmospheric locations filled with secrets, traps, and lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Power</strong> \u2013 Find upgrades, unlock sword modifiers, and adapt your playstyle as the difficulty ramps up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your blades \u2014 or be destroyed by them.</p>","developers":["Don BASS"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],